<i>inner workings of a technology.</i>

2049
01:28:46,861 --> 01:28:48,696
<i>It's not about</i>
<i>the billionaire CEOs.</i>

2050
01:28:48,729 --> 01:28:50,665
<i>It's not about the geopolitics.</i>

2051
01:28:50,698 --> 01:28:53,935
<i>It's not about the terrifying</i>
<i>future or the end of the world,</i>

2052
01:28:53,968 --> 01:28:56,137
<i>because my world</i>
<i>is just starting.</i>

2053
01:28:56,170 --> 01:28:57,972
