<i>AI is gonna change everything</i>

2057
01:29:02,777 --> 01:29:05,913
<i>in ways too powerful and</i>
<i>complex for us to understand.</i>

2058
01:29:05,947 --> 01:29:09,717
<i>And the future is not</i>
<i>for any of us to decide.</i>

2059
01:29:10,818 --> 01:29:13,921
<i> But what I can decide is to be</i>
<i>the best possible husband</i>

2060
01:29:13,955 --> 01:29:17,992
