01:36:44,938 --> 01:36:47,141
<i>the capacity to feel.</i>

2245
01:36:49,376 --> 01:36:51,345
-(indistinct mission chatter)
-(cheering)

2246
01:36:51,378 --> 01:36:54,315
<i>We have to double down</i>
<i>more and more</i>

2247
01:36:54,348 --> 01:36:57,384
<i>on those capacities</i>
<i>that we have as humans</i>

2248
01:36:57,418 --> 01:36:59,853
<i>that robotic systems</i>
<i>will never have.</i>

2249
